                <pb facs="0212" n="200" sameAs="frus:frus1942v05/pg200"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20210/1533: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador m Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-06-09T20:00:00-03:00">June 9, 1942—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1948. My 1178, April 7, 7 p.m.<anchor n="29" xml:id="d195-f1"/> Acting on clues
                    furnished by Othmar Gamillshegg and Adalbert Vamszer police of Federal District
                    last night seized another clandestine transmitter on a farm owned by Kurt
                    Weingartner. Weingartner was recently arrested by police of the State of Rio and
                    is connected with Engels and Ramus. His mistress Helen Lohse who is said to have
                    been very active is in custody here.</p>
                <p>Please inform F. B. I. immediately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
